From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] userenv: LoadUserProfile, AppContainer profiles, CreateLinkFile (3710)

userenv: LoadUserProfile/UnloadUserProfile, AppContainer profiles, CreateLinkFile

LoadUserProfile returned HKEY_CURRENT_USER for every token and
UnloadUserProfile failed. Now LoadUserProfile validates PROFILEINFO,
requires an enabled administrator (or LocalSystem) holding SeBackup and
SeRestore in the process token, creates the profile directory, and hands out
a KEY_ALL_ACCESS handle to HKEY_USERS\<the token user's SID>, which
UnloadUserProfile closes. CreateAppContainerProfile creates the profile
(registry mapping, storage key, Packages folder with ACL) and returns
ERROR_ALREADY_EXISTS the second time; DeleteAppContainerProfile,
GetAppContainerFolderPath and GetAppContainerRegistryLocation are new.
GetAllUsersProfileDirectory returns ProgramData. Ordinal 138 creates a
.lnk in a CSIDL folder.
---
